Content:
Everything is coming from the Netherlands, i kid you not. I live there

one thing tho:
@4:43 "it contains a novel substance: Methamphetamine,  the active ingredient of Crystal meth" is wrong.  "crystal meth" is methamphetamine hydrochloride. 
Pervitin was Methamphetamine Sulfate.

@5:22 Not only Germany, but EVERY country that was or is involved in war,, hasA experimented with Methamphetamine on its infantry TO THIS DAY. the US was and is much worse.
Also: Hitler was addicted on meth.

@8:59 "at sixteen it did not work anymore, i started driving to the czech republic.."   is bullshit. Drivers Licenses are  issued from 18 and older in the EU.
@9:22 "Czech republic is leading production" is wrong. They used to.  The Netherlands is leading production these days.
@9:29 "producing meth requires both the right equipment and expertise in chemistry" Not really. Everyone can download "uncle fester" books online, for free and it can be made with stuff like pots and pans if one has to. 
 @9:32 (mistakes and just bullshit information starts to ramp up)  "every meth cook needs to have ephedrine" is just insane how not true this is. First of all it is "PSEUDO-Ephedrine"
@10:04 It isn't really "smuggling," now is it? Since the EU has open borders and all.....
@10:40 Right.. a random meth user from germany (speaking with a dutch accent but ok) picks up his user-amount of stuff right from the lab in another country... come on...
@12:45 An addiction of any type that costs "several thousands of euros a month" will get noticed by people. lets say.. his parents? Where were they? Did they not see their son was awake for several nights in a row, and asleep after for extremely extended periods of time? This is starting to get outright unbelievable and a waste of my time
